WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.327
Self-regulation through touch
is a strategy that can be used

2
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.257
when we're under a lot
of stress or anxiety

3
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.412
and involves seeking regulation
through our own touch.

4
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.720
There are several, and I'm going
to teach you four ways of doing it.

5
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.057
The first one I want to teach you involves
placing your hand on your chest,

6
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.077
one hand above the chest
and the other below it.

7
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.327
This strategy is also used
in controlled breathing,

8
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.570
which is also covered
here in this toolkit.

9
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:43.097
The aim is for you to feel it,
but if you combine it with breathing,

10
00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.057
you also add the sensation
of feeling your chest

11
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.848
and belly rising and falling.

12
00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:56.416
Another strategy you can use
involves touching your own hands.

13
00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:59.697
If we put our hands
in contact with ourselves,

14
00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.757
we can apply slight pressure,

15
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.245
almost as if we were comforting
someone. How would we do it?

16
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.017
That pressure is the pressure
you should use on yourself.

17
00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.787
Another strategy you can use

18
00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:16.107
is putting your arms around your body,

19
00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.747
almost as if we were
giving ourselves a hug,

20
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.961
almost as if we were comforting ourselves.

21
00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:27.797
This self-hug should also have some
pressure, gentle, not suffocating;

22
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:30.509
it should be calm and comforting, ok?

23
00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.197
And finally, placing your feet
on the floor and pressing down slightly,

24
00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.857
so that we notice we are here,
in the present moment,

25
00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.865
almost like a grounding thought, ok?

26
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.647
These strategies can be used and done for

27
00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:51.267
30 seconds to a minute,
and the aim is a kind of self-comfort.
